SUMMARY:(CS)²AI Online™ Seminar: Cyber\, ZTA & AI for Critical Infrastructure
DESCRIPTION:Nashville Cyber Security for Control Systems ***The importance of cyber securing our critical infrastructure has never been more apparent.*** Join Jeff and Derek to discuss what progress has been made and how recent developments in Zero Trust Architecture and AI are impacting the effort to protect our essential systems and assets. Jeff's talk will also address the crucial point that cyber security is just one step in the journey towards the real goal of cyber resiliency\, of infrastructure continuing to function as needed despite incidents and attacks. **[Click here to REGISTER for the event](https://events.zoom.us/ev/AmuDhppj6bkQn9jBI2sAir7nEaW8uulRNCxYt8F0Y4-ujSdeMOMy~AiFO5T_4KXfInWYOpz_lGyNoy3mwIaDNQgiXEIinMaN5S3HaknbFJUGwIt_7cCFPupVFfxv-YwCi6wsY4pkejZu7zQ)** ***[https://events.zoom.us/ev/AmuDhppj6bkQn9jBI2sAir7nEaW8uulRNCxYt8F0Y4-ujSdeMOMy~AiFO5T_4KXfInWYOpz_lGyNoy3mwIaDNQgiXEIinMaN5S3HaknbFJUGwIt_7cCFPupVFfxv-YwCi6wsY4pkejZu7zQ](https://events.zoom.us/ev/AmuDhppj6bkQn9jBI2sAir7nEaW8uulRNCxYt8F0Y4-ujSdeMOMy~AiFO5T_4KXfInWYOpz_lGyNoy3mwIaDNQgiXEIinMaN5S3HaknbFJUGwIt_7cCFPupVFfxv-YwCi6wsY4pkejZu7zQ)*** \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\- Becoming a paid member is quick and easy (and helps us keep offering free educational opportunities!). Please join now! [https://www.cs2ai.org/plans-pricing](https://www.cs2ai.org/plans-pricing) All past seminars and symposiums are available to paid [CS2AI.ORG](http://cs2ai.org/) members. Check out the Resources area of our website in the Members Portal [https://www.cs2ai.org/](https://www.cs2ai.org/) Certificates for Professional Development/Continuing Education Units (PDUs/CEUs) are available for all registered individuals who attend at least one hour of the event. [https://www.cs2ai.org/get-involved](https://www.cs2ai.org/get-involved) \\*Please note that (CS)²AI Online™ events are provided free of charge as educational career development content through the support of our paid members and the generous contributions of our corporate Strategic Alliance Partners. Contact information used in registering for our directly supported seminars may be shared with sponsors funding those specific events. Unless noted on our Zoom Event registration page\, all events are open for direct funding support. © Control System Cyber Security Association International 2026 | Source: Nashville Cyber Security for Control Systems | Tags: cyber\, security | https://www.meetup.com/nashville-cyber-security-for-control-systems/events/316297360/
